    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Scientific Model Card & Validation Context",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Core:** `forecasting_v1` | **Model Architecture:** `CatBoost Gradient Boosted Decision Trees (Regressor)`\n**Evaluation Horizon:** 20 out-of-sample forward days across 20 retail outlets and 48 SKUs (19,200 evaluated episodes).\n> \u26a0\ufe0f **Model Performance Context:** Predictions are strictly out-of-sample evaluated on purged test partitions. WAPE captures absolute percentage deviation relative to aggregate physical throughput."
      }
    },
